Package: linux-keyboard-patcher
Version: 1.0-8
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Blek <www.farhanperdana.com>
Depends: python3, zenity, pkexec, grub2-common | grub2
Description: Fixing unusable keyboard after GRUB
 GUI and terminal tool that temporarily adds four keyboard-related GRUB
 entries and lets the user make the working entry's kernel parameters permanent.
